===Etymology===
An Anglicization of the {{etyl|fra-aca|en}} {{term|Cadien|lang=fr}}, an {{l/en|aphæresis|aphaeretic}} form of {{term|Acadien||Acadian|lang=fr}}, reflecting the palatization of {{IPAchar|/dj/}} to {{IPAchar|/d͡ʒ/}} in the Acadian dialect.

